          "title": "Classification with Abstention Under Class-Conditional Error Constraints",
          "title_zh": "类别条件误差约束下的带弃权分类",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.22632v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_top",
          "organization": "MiniMax",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.22632",
          "summary": "The paper studies binary classification with abstention under separate class-conditional error constraints, aiming to minimize abstention while keeping both errors below prescribed thresholds. It characterizes the distribution-free minimax rate of excess abstention risk, introduces surrogate-loss formulations with finite-sample guarantees, and analyzes computational complexity in the convex setting.",
